{"job_id":"F-16ed6e5bfa3407cd8d23","family_id":"F-16ed6e5bfa3407cd8d23","title":"중국ㆍ인도네시아 및 태국산 폴리프로필렌 연신필름에 대한 덤핑방지관세 부과에 관한 규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014879-270953-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":47,"target_id":"d6a00e5c25dc6eec1e42134cfb734794cc9972adeff45007c0a9ef5a919107ad","source_hash":"dcb310a904967b8fa6398b948857162f86ef5e0cd27e73f962ac811fdb14b049","text":"关于对来自中国、印度尼西亚和泰国的聚丙烯拉伸膜征收反倾销税的规则"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014879-270953-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":86,"target_id":"a7f2076bc84dae748fee1a8695c8558af0d047f29648264d103724e6608b7573","source_hash":"86cfb2ce63a07f2b5e25ff29894dac92fef4b0253e13facba956086678054790","text":"第一条（目的）本规则的目的是根据《海关法》第五十一条指定应缴纳反倾销税的商品和供应商，并规定适用于该等商品的关税税率。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014879-270953-ko","scope":"BODY","start":86,"end":286,"target_id":"c857f447a5bc27a2bb9786de2ff2226aa1f754bb1af1415e223f762c8a4e9382","source_hash":"40e45e2cd669fca95d1c0e7d85bfce20a98af1ec4fda4b2cbddb69f54b4bf67d","text":"第二条（征税对象） 应征收反倾销税的货物为产自中国、印度尼西亚和泰国的聚丙烯拉伸薄膜（指根据《海关法实施令》第九十八条第一款，对应海关和统计协调制度税号3920.20.0000或3921.90.2000的货物），厚度为10微米（μm）及以上。但附件一所列货物除外。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014879-270953-ko","scope":"BODY","start":286,"end":363,"target_id":"d45ae79b5a2ee554fd8b03abf04a1854fca93bd8a330f00d280426ac682c8b5f","source_hash":"8d5337d71b318f506644d5c654179168f2e06d4aa8fe88177518c16b22b089cb","text":"第3条（受征税货物的供应商和反倾销税税率）根据第2条规定受征税货物的供应商以及各供应商的反倾销税税率如附表2所示。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014879-270953-ko","scope":"BODY","start":363,"end":2153,"target_id":"fcbc2a8b18c797469542b5617b28e68cd67ac509c33ded2947fc3c1c5b2536de","source_hash":"fcca440ee9e9b78a2fd7823d9d6a27001a50838c708d47e7d95d45c387507558","text":"补充规定 <第1125号，2025年4月25日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n免征反倾销税的商品（与第2条但书有关）\n■ 对来自中国、印度尼西亚和泰国的聚丙烯拉伸膜征收反倾销税   \n\n  关于征收的规则 [附件 1]                                                 \n\n  免征反倾销税的商品（与第2条但书有关）                  \n\n  ┌───┬───────────────────┬───┬─────┐    \n\n  │国家│供应商 │型号名称│厚度 (㎛) │    \n\n  ├───┼───────────────────┼───┼─────┤    \n\n  │印度尼西亚│PT Indopoly Swakarsa │DHR │18 │    \n\n  │Sia │工业 Tbk.) ├───┼─────┤    \n\n  │      │                                      │SHO   │23, 25    │    \n\n  │      │                                      ├───┼─────┤    \n\n  │      │                                      │SHR   │18, 20, 25│    \n\n  │      │                                      ├───┼─────┤    \n\n  │      │                                      │SHRV  │25        │    \n\n  │      │                                      ├───┼─────┤    \n\n  │      │                                      │DHSH  │18        │    \n\n  │      ├───────────────────┼───┼─────┤    \n\n  │ │PT Argha Karya Prima Industry │PSP │20 │    \n\n  │      │Tbk.)                                 ├───┼─────┤    \n\n  │      │                                      │PXAS  │23        │    \n\n  │      │                                      ├───┼─────┤    \n\n  │      │                                      │PXA   │20, 23, 33│    \n\n  │      ├───────────────────┼───┼─────┤    \n\n  │ │Trias (PT Trias Sentosa Tbk.) │HSS │18, 19.5 │    \n\n  │      │                                      ├───┼─────┤    \n\n  │      │                                      │THSS  │18        │    \n\n  │      │                                      ├───┼─────┤    \n\n  │      │                                      │THSSO │18        │    \n\n"},{"id":"A39785-zh-00001","doc":"A39785","law_id":"kr-014879-270953-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2880899","source_hash":"66e766b2a7852b63d9dcd22d9a980e41ab0ccfc0f7ac008d366a321e73500794","text":"■ 对来自中国、印度尼西亚和泰国的聚丙烯拉伸膜征收反倾销税"},{"id":"A39785-zh-00002","doc":"A39785","law_id":"kr-014879-270953-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2880900","source_hash":"9ae675ce7bbd86692d1fb618be00c04bc3be0aab569025df1f4a46e26c96e5a5","text":"征税